messages.content:
Review this proposed change (review round 1).

Repository: infra-observability at ref dd2ed379434fc2617880908d91dc7194137513b9 (use these as the repo and ref arguments of read_repo_file).

Hypothesis about the failure: The Terraform plan failed because main.tf references an input variable `cost_center` on line 10 that is not declared in variables.tf, causing Terraform to reject the configuration.

Proposed unified diff:
```diff
--- a/variables.tf
+++ b/variables.tf
@@ -5,3 +5,7 @@ variable "region" {
 variable "environment" {
   type = string
 }
+
+variable "cost_center" {
+  type = string
+}
```

Current contents of variables.tf:
```
variable "region" {
  type    = string
  default = "us-east-1"
}

variable "environment" {
  type = string
}

```

